/user:info/drannoyingdog" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2425082&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533150463" alt="DrAnnoyingDog" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2425082)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drannoyingdog" >DrAnnoyingDog</a></span> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/secretcrow" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3604422&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533150463" alt="SecretCrow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3604422)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/secretcrow" >SecretCrow</a></span></p> <p>Thank you all so much for being great critters and helping Maya come to her own.<br /> You are all excellent.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Click&nbsp;here&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;about&nbsp;this&nbsp;critter's&nbsp;pictures!!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Hooray!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ursus_arctos_syriacus.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ursus_arctos_syriacus.jpg</a><br /> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Syrischer_Braunb%C3%A4r_Tiergarten_Heidelberg.JPG">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Syrischer_Braunb%C3%A4r_Tiergarten_Heidelberg.JPG</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <p>If you like what I write, feel free to check out my ugly author page!<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/uncle-nicolini-author-page">Click here to question why 3 seconds from now!</a></p> 
